OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 23 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Dvorak
OL,5,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,6,     Gand loves of Antonin Dvorak.
OL,7,     GToday, all aboard as we join him
OL,8,     Gon memorable journeys and
OL,9,     Gdiscover his passion for all
OL,10,     Gthings transport.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined in 80A
OL,13,     Gby a quintet from Shear Brass, to
OL,14,     Gpresent music by Sir George
OL,15,     GShearing. Harpist Elizabeth Bass
OL,16,     Gis also in session.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,20,     Gincluding music by Chaminade,
OL,21,     GGlinka and Mozart.
