OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 23 JAN
OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GLet the BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,6,     GOrchestra whisk you away for a
OL,7,     Gnight of classic West End
OL,8,     Gmusicals under the baton of
OL,9,     Gconductor Ben Palmer.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Stories from the
OL,11,     FMuseum of Music History
OL,12,     GKate Kennedy examines the role of
OL,13,     Gthe 19th-century military
OL,14,     GQuadrille and reimagines its
OL,15,     Gsound from a fragment of military
OL,16,     Gmusic found on the battlefield of
OL,17,     GWaterloo.
