OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 23 JAN
OL,4,G2200FLate Junction
OL,5,     GJennifer Lucy Allan sits down
OL,6,     Gwith Brazilian journalist and
OL,7,     Gfilmmaker GG Albuquerque to
OL,8,     Gexplore the experimental sound of
OL,9,     Gbaile funk.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto shares more highlights
OL,12,     Gfrom the powerhouse trumpeter's
OL,13,     Grecent performance.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GThe Swedish Radio Symphony
OL,16,     GOrchestra performs Ravel's Piano
OL,17,     GConcerto in G with Lucas
OL,18,     GDebargue. Opening the concert is
OL,19,     GEleven Gates, a piece by Swedish
OL,20,     Gcomposer Anders Hillborg.
